frontend/dist-web
# Entirely generated by `wails generate module` (which `wails build`
# runs for you). Nothing here is tracked: tsc resolves @wails/* through
# the tsconfig paths that point at src/platform/*.web, and vite aliases
# them per mode, so a fresh clone type-checks and builds without this
# directory existing at all.
